--- 3.3 THE ENVELOPE THAT TRAVELS (reference, no file changes)

For the reviewer: this is what a signalbus target can carry. Both agents vendor
it; neither imports the other's code.

    signal_id       producer-generated, opaque, bounded length
    ts              one instant, in UTC, and the only temporal value present
    producer        finance | life
    kind            money_pressure | recovery_state | whoop_readiness | ...
    tier            money_safe | life_safe        (and nothing else)
    consent_scope   shared | producer_only        (a subscriber must honour it)
    payload         level     green | amber | red
                    direction a direction, not a magnitude
                    note      at most 120 characters, directional, no digits
    hash            digest over the fields above; integrity, not authentication

Note that the family classification is not a possible value of tier. It is not
filtered out of the tier enumeration - it was never a member, so a signal
claiming it fails as an unknown value rather than as a policy refusal. Failing
earlier is the point.

--- 3.4 TESTS TO ADD: NIZAM__system/governor/tests/test_classifier.py

Add these. The third is the one that must never be deleted.

```python
def test_the_bus_is_reachable_from_the_two_narrow_tiers():
    assert not is_egress_blocked("money_safe", "signalbus")
    assert not is_egress_blocked("life_safe", "signalbus")


def test_the_bus_is_unreachable_from_every_pre_existing_tier():
    """Financial figures, health signals and journal text do not reach the bus.

    They reach it only after being reduced to a directional signal in one of the
    two narrow tiers, and that reduction is an act at a call site.
    """
    for tier in (
        "<FAMILY_CLASSIFICATION>",
        "strict_local",
        "review_before_commit",
        "private_github",
        "mirror_sanitized",
    ):
        assert is_egress_blocked(tier, "signalbus"), tier


def test_the_family_tier_egress_set_is_empty_and_stays_empty():
    """The invariant this change is most likely to break quietly.

    Asserted as emptiness rather than as the absence of the bus, so that adding
    ANY target to this row fails here.
    """
    assert EGRESS_MATRIX["<FAMILY_CLASSIFICATION>"] == set()


def test_no_pre_existing_tier_lost_a_target():
    """This change adds. Nothing it does removes or renames."""
    for tier in ("strict_local", "review_before_commit", "private_github", "mirror_sanitized"):
        assert EGRESS_MATRIX[tier], tier


def test_the_two_narrow_tiers_reach_nothing_but_the_bus():
    for tier in ("money_safe", "life_safe"):
        assert EGRESS_MATRIX[tier] == {"signalbus"}, tier
